#: scenario7:scenario7_F1D91C51_4F99_4780_829C_DFD37ACB336A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 76649de170144363bc72076a3ea1c347a2f1e0488d323c11dc2684612a780f96
#. default-sha256: aac8e585b1f8cc3041010dcd8ad127ca1ecc72bae5830958ab710c6e88418ab2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F1D91C51_4F99_4780_829C_DFD37ACB336A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫The next day, I awoke with a "
"terrible fever."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫다음 날――, ⟪k:12⟫고열이 몸을 좀먹었"
"다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_5A90CE79_FF7B_4187_BAE0_20AF39FCD941
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 859f2890ede6796b75f4afb000ea1d29a95c6b2ef12ad6ac5166009e68a44ee5
#. default-sha256: c5d47ec108dd0da9553387ed75ec56710466196d0ee509279307138c6a39a8af
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5A90CE79_FF7B_4187_BAE0_20AF39FCD941"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I hovered in a sweltering wave of heat, unable to tell dream and reality apart, listening to "
"a seemingly endless stream of cracking noises."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫비몽사몽한 작열의 틈새에서――⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫금이 가는 소리를 들었다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_2358D0B0_F81B_49DC_98A5_0E40E057D26E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dc834e5e11c5e0aac40da4eb5f365baaf52f9f73522bd4c841962a38c1a50f57
#. default-sha256: d7d328862129c47d7694600ba297cd90d5bc45115024438f4ca805f207edd0f1
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2358D0B0_F81B_49DC_98A5_0E40E057D26E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The sounds were coming from inside my body.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I thought I was falling apart."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫아무래도 그건 ⟪k:1⟫몸 안에서 난 소리인지――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫내가 ⟪k:4⟫무너지는 소리겠거니 싶었다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9A6ABD87_065F_45B1_98C4_5C7CEDE5CDE5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 91cbc9d4577aa2a35bdd30757d049e52341e27b1de8bf06d943a1d343c4e5653
#. default-sha256: ae939cd4da881df7934a2e1effbe0441d9598c0ef0f9ad48f716c28aeea6f1a1
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9A6ABD87_065F_45B1_98C4_5C7CEDE5CDE5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Mother was horribly worried."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫어머니는 나를 몹시 걱정했다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_BE7745A7_EBC2_4845_902B_6BB1BD2FE613
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bbf98ff2ddfe81c36d9879e843d2783dd638bbdf335c43a2ba29463c0d652a02
#. default-sha256: 0c14b67aef813ca80a2e566efc7cb41f86858f94e60abbc53629309880625bdd
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BE7745A7_EBC2_4845_902B_6BB1BD2FE613"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had never been the most healthy child, but I had never fallen this ill either."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나는 원래부터 몸이 튼튼하진 않지만, ⟪k:1⟫이만큼 앓는 건 처음이었다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9A50E480_AE92_4FBF_90B9_11ED809885BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7c8defab59dc3eefab9272dee0e05b3852e8d6b63ec56c0fbf8a8daa6b4f5b98
#. default-sha256: 9d161653b1adc5da80b61660fdb4c846dd052ab7580dd2133ef12552b0fe1c04
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9A50E480_AE92_4FBF_90B9_11ED809885BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I couldn’t get out of bed.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫My voice was raspy, like an old woman’s.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I was "
"genuinely afraid I would wither away and die."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫몸도 못 가누었고, ⟪k:1⟫목소리를 내도 노인처럼 갈라져서――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫나도 ⟪k:4⟫내가 이대로 죽는 "
"거 아닌가 싶을 지경이었다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9DFE4400_A100_4512_A293_640E884E0448
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ae6dbeacc2e2b93332901f6a93b6715483d660dafac86ee2c366da9c47799897
#. default-sha256: ce40a13ea68ca85b0984e12fd4ce9145a33b8d4371e127c09e8c08a6b3866f8f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9DFE4400_A100_4512_A293_640E884E0448"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Mother called in doctor after doctor to see me, but they all said it was the flu."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 후 ⟪k:1⟫여러 의사가 왔지만, ⟪k:2⟫다들 감기란 진단 결과만 내고 돌아갔다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9B0872F9_8B72_4CCD_BCA1_00968A4D19CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7989efd974c12b91e9329deea48c08c6831b442cf9604a176ffe5fefb8f24c7a
#. default-sha256: 9e0436df7e4d553abfaee149ea2bcc1436c199eb88738bb5dfbfdd507f407edf
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9B0872F9_8B72_4CCD_BCA1_00968A4D19CC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That bodily pain was common with a fever."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫고열이 날 때 ⟪k:1⟫몸이 쑤시는 건 흔한 경우라고 했다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_B0834569_89A7_4A75_8EEB_ADC8174E35E9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4942850cd835054e115c3ee40383f5048a6fab22f342cbe0b38c12ab929aa159
#. default-sha256: 4b78fc8115c935f7962428a89420e7f18a74078b17e34417aee79f10ed8ed164
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B0834569_89A7_4A75_8EEB_ADC8174E35E9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫While there was a doctor in the house, Mother was able to remain relatively calm,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫어머니는 의사가 있을 때는 ⟪k:1⟫침착했지만――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_5B8AFEEF_7744_4E0A_B95A_8D0ADFF881A3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e33173aa06abc84110530593ea0dbc3a0a7dd951d9c62b37f6e1f37bbbcabbba
#. default-sha256: a29d52adc7d3d7e5ef26e943310dc40db8a65afeca599e2b5d95dba62b4a22e5
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5B8AFEEF_7744_4E0A_B95A_8D0ADFF881A3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but once they were gone, the anxiety came back. ⟪k:1⟫She stayed with me, day and night, even "
"foregoing sleep."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아무도 없으면 ⟪k:1⟫불안정해져서 ⟪k:2⟫잠도 거의 안 자고 나를 돌보았다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_930E5261_C89B_49F8_B299_A99BF37D8E3D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 052b6ef7f9261d753b44666fa2b5ff0329ee14287dee2dbe8c72cca3cda168c4
#. default-sha256: e08e088cd509ebfbb6458d8113d27068f170585403a991e95e5a6697ab6ac255
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_930E5261_C89B_49F8_B299_A99BF37D8E3D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Her hands gripped mine. They held me fast."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫어머니의 손이 ⟪k:1⟫내 손가락과 ⟪k:2⟫내 몸을 감쌌다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_CB48627A_80F4_499B_BD28_D389CCD92A26
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a29ac0c649130de41795a060c255ef7a76a972399fbe5ca4088eefbba62476d8
#. default-sha256: 2fe284c7818ccb85e0b4e258f71e76e38878ee12b5307e76f8fe3c4f6d935058
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CB48627A_80F4_499B_BD28_D389CCD92A26"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She had her head bowed, as if in prayer."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫어머니는 신이나 천사에게 애원하는 것처럼 ⟪k:1⟫고개 숙이고 있었다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_884467C2_57AC_43E9_BAD3_47857FA710BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4a10a7c72971df07c0cff7665436ae824ab3ea6c283d829577386ed1aac8fc99
#. default-sha256: f21276deb1ab94cc1ea2c3eb9b1ac43f6d69c29b611acd16dbae5daa7a87f7e9
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_884467C2_57AC_43E9_BAD3_47857FA710BE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Don’t worry... ⟪k:1⟫It’ll be all right, Michelle.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫God is watching over you... ⟪k:4⟫"
"He will protect you..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫미셸…… ⟪k:1⟫미셸…… ⟪k:2⟫괜찮을 거란다.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫주님께서…… 굽어살피실 거야……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_DBA90755_DFD7_4EC8_A226_250D17981B38
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c86743bdb49ea62cbe35dacc0843cd4a15a50b990c41cfb60807cae6f6a9c234
#. default-sha256: 90b4cd45884ad172e222ff2132983cc20638bbc9a9b2a7297bf8330fe8f6b573
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_DBA90755_DFD7_4EC8_A226_250D17981B38"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You are His child...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You are His angel sent to Earth..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫너는 ⟪k:1⟫주님의 아이잖니…….⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫천사의 화신이잖니……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_F151E5BB_71B9_4D70_B606_94E38C173BAA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d9f70bf34355af12e54f3bff022b12b0e3dfc42bfc234eba873708b52d56fd70
#. default-sha256: 13c7d471529f0453d75018fb7281d8839489c6b54dd3789a664b37d7e404b8c0
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F151E5BB_71B9_4D70_B606_94E38C173BAA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He will not forsake you...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The doctors say it’s just the flu..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저버리실 리가 없어…….⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫의사들도 ⟪k:3⟫모두 감기라 했어……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_8F36946A_C49E_475F_9514_0BD7E7BC2449
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c54c3a40cb3d3d08bd29d9096bcd94170b556ee5dcdb62b040fd4222abbc59e4
#. default-sha256: 651506674fbd54f478b44871947d75d6c8a31a238ef786f943fff062645b0c0c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_8F36946A_C49E_475F_9514_0BD7E7BC2449"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though her words seemed to be directed at me, there was a vacantness in her voice, as if "
"they were really for herself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫어머니는 ⟪k:1⟫나에게 말하는 것 같았지만, ⟪k:2⟫그 말은 공허했다.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫본인을 안심시키려고 "
"⟪k:5⟫되뇌는 것이다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_3E6EACDC_4063_44A7_A907_1D8A41C134C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ba3ff941d45cfb7d0734ecd44b13a13da5099576a3bbd324e985dc01f8c9e3eb
#. default-sha256: 34fac41d1754f83fe310746e72c1a35a0dd6ae0e04249d8b1b13a150a41f3056
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3E6EACDC_4063_44A7_A907_1D8A41C134C3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫For so long, she had wanted a daughter."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫어머니는 진심으로 딸을 원했다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_AE779766_B600_44A3_826C_F89A5EA9FB46
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 59f3af45369d3bd2c6d8baf0cd5e1274cf778172db8cdb56a577025f127e1a7b
#. default-sha256: 880e0be733a0a9d40841fc61e86cee856d8fbdf8799ce6284ce446e321fea0c8
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_AE779766_B600_44A3_826C_F89A5EA9FB46"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I couldn’t understand her fixation,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫왜 그렇게까지 집착하는진 모르겠지만――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_D55C7EBE_B4DE_40DE_A881_F0DC1A124062
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1f71b299cae4180ba5340b3d5c5f6281ee98dbcfde140b94646377bf521bb7ab
#. default-sha256: b42385bffd5b5913fad587803fe6be224991445cc183d5291c2c9652e539698a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D55C7EBE_B4DE_40DE_A881_F0DC1A124062"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but seeing her there through my cloudy eyes, I wanted to apologize for ever thinking "
"spending time with her was agonizing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫몽롱한 시야 속에서 ⟪k:1⟫그 모습을 보고,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫함께 지내기 고통스럽게 여기던 걸 ⟪k:4⟫사죄하"
"고 싶어졌다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_E8A1882A_69ED_4483_985D_36EC44A05515
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0ff6f63f2033e2c0c3a7664c3cad66c7f29228d972eb749ca664b8c5ba02b6e0
#. default-sha256: 68d2b90538121d8a0ec9ac15c9cdb97fee368b31ab9f1ef831aa234ba51f5975
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E8A1882A_69ED_4483_985D_36EC44A05515"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫How are you feeling?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Your mother’s here for you. Don’t worry."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫괴롭니……? ⟪k:1⟫이 어머니는 여기 있단다, ⟪k:2⟫안심하렴……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_4BFC0A0A_CF7B_43E8_AFE0_C0BD252C0900
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 253b7c268d0a6dd78ad5239666a1ed877c6c718b439c07aa415722c65e835742
#. default-sha256: 73abfbf1a8227a39ee6d3f281ce72957f2588e1c217604ffba417feec448ce38
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4BFC0A0A_CF7B_43E8_AFE0_C0BD252C0900"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But the only sound that came from my mouth was a faint gasp."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫내 말은 소리를 이루지 못 했다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_ABF6BBD6_A164_4D4A_9737_D1FF16AD80E6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 30fa55c338a2942e887aaf3bf122aa415fe0ffae1d7f6a6a447be569429e909b
#. default-sha256: 5ee31c177f20dd58c8166b2cace1294b5de5fbe07678934037c8405f69559eae
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_ABF6BBD6_A164_4D4A_9737_D1FF16AD80E6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I drifted in and out of sleep, Mother’s hand wrapped around my own."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나는 어머니의 손길을 느끼며, ⟪k:1⟫이미 여러 번 거듭된 잠에 빠졌다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_BE583775_9281_49FD_AD87_8E850FF4C7F2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 436223f8557dde4b1ff79a0e7db2133cc2e36f7d11afa209bfca52ce46218039
#. default-sha256: 51a0ed813ece3f2c285dd2042bb6ed086f50acfffcefcc9368416360e300fa02
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BE583775_9281_49FD_AD87_8E850FF4C7F2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And I had numerous dreams."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그리고 여러 번 거듭하여 꿈을 꾸었다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_A98538DF_E530_42E4_857B_6E0DB5206773
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2dbeb87c4d18a81c108bf343b747a6f633d0124af7095d82573bba16e3b57549
#. default-sha256: 265e50b0c9ee8db72211cf87c86ca1523854fdad8aa34f9ddfb3ceee5595d369
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A98538DF_E530_42E4_857B_6E0DB5206773"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫In my dreams, I was a man."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫나는 꿈 속에서 ⟪k:3⟫남자였다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_17B971C9_54DD_4ECA_879A_10A0738677A7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2bcf6d872682bf3e5a4c1c2113e66479f9deb5ed12661c2bb28cd65312246b63
#. default-sha256: 92decf2e0fc2fbb46bd2f06fd8c9de0de1b2df9571147dafc3aaf01b8cb7342d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_17B971C9_54DD_4ECA_879A_10A0738677A7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫In my dreams, I was Didier and I was Georges."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫나는 꿈 속에서 ⟪k:3⟫디디에이자 ⟪k:4⟫조르주였다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_56939500_E8C9_47AA_ADD1_22312681BFA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c8667a2abb9b0307fb1d31621f9210f5b176c32dba081ec5d76fe6ef6ab4c1fc
#. default-sha256: 4e396dffe4d5ade00beada5b78b3933ad65575397e4755865d3c701c2c5d3d6d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_56939500_E8C9_47AA_ADD1_22312681BFA3"
